  "description": "Born an omega, Ha Ian lives a quiet life focused on modest goals and day-to-day survival. But his peace shatters when he reunites with Jeong Hyeon, a man tied to the sins of his past. Hyeon demands that Ian work as his secretary to repay an enormous debt, binding him once more to a fate he thought he had escaped. As the weight of guilt and old wounds resurfaces, Ian must face the question: can true atonement ever be found in the shadow of his past?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
